# 🔥 Consistent Hashing - The Genius Trick Behind Scalable Distributed Systems 🌍

> **One Line Definition**
>
> Consistent Hashing ek aisi technique hai jo data ko multiple servers me distribute karti hai aur ensure karti hai ki **node add/remove hone par minimum data move ho.**
>
> 🎯 Goal:
>
> **"Cluster grow/shrink ho, par poora data dubara move na karna pade."**

---

# 🤔 Sabse Pehle Problem Samjho

Suppose tumhare paas 3 servers hain.

```
Server A
Server B
Server C
```

Aur users ka data store karna hai.

Example:

```
User1
User2
User3
User4
User5
```

Question:

```
Kaunsa user kis server pe jayega?
```

---

# Naive Solution 😎

Hash function use karo.

```
server = hash(key) % N
```

where

```
N = Number of Servers
```

Example

```
N = 3
```

---

## Example

```
hash(User1)=10

10 % 3 = 1

→ Server B
```

---

```
hash(User2)=25

25 % 3 = 1

→ Server B
```

---

```
hash(User3)=35

35 % 3 = 2

→ Server C
```

Simple.

Sab khush. 😎

